flowchart LR
    C[Client Session] --> GW[Recommendation Gateway]
    GW --> CG1[Candidate Gen: Similar Content]
    GW --> CG2[Candidate Gen: Subscriptions]
    GW --> CG3[Candidate Gen: Trending]
    CG1 --> LR[Lightweight Ranker]
    CG2 --> LR
    CG3 --> LR
    LR --> HR[Heavy Ranker Value Model]
    HR --> TOP[Top-K Response]
    TOP --> C
    C --> FB[Feedback Events]
    FB --> FS[(Feature Store)]
    FS --> CG1
    FS --> LR
    FS --> HR
